{"seq":2,"slug":"text-classification","title":"文本分类与过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/ir-applications/text-classification","wordCount":1089,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"文本分类与过滤\">文本分类与过滤</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>文本分类（Text Classification）是将文档自动归入预定义类别的任务，是信息检索系统中内容理解和组织的基础能力。在 IR 系统中，文本分类广泛应用于查询意图识别（导航型/信息型/事务型）、文档类型分类（教程/参考/问答）、垃圾邮件过滤、情感分析和主题标注。文本过滤（Text Filtering）则是分类的在线版本——对持续到达的文档流进行实时分类和路由。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 文本分类流程&#10;        D[文档] --&gt; F[特征提取]&#10;        F --&gt; M[分类模型]&#10;        M --&gt; C[类别预测]&#10;        L[标注数据] --&gt; T[模型训练]&#10;        T --&gt; M&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 文本过滤流程&#10;        S[文档流] --&gt; FI[过滤器]&#10;        FI --&gt; A[接受]&#10;        FI --&gt; R[拒绝]&#10;        FB[用户反馈] --&gt; FI&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 文本分类流程\n        D[文档] --&gt; F[特征提取]\n        F --&gt; M[分类模型]\n        M --&gt; C[类别预测]\n        L[标注数据] --&gt; T[模型训练]\n        T --&gt; M\n    end\n    subgraph 文本过滤流程\n        S[文档流] --&gt; FI[过滤器]\n        FI --&gt; A[接受]\n        FI --&gt; R[拒绝]\n        FB[用户反馈] --&gt; FI\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类任务</th>\n<th>类别数</th>\n<th>典型方法</th>\n<th>IR 中的应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二分类</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>SVM, 逻辑回归</td>\n<td>垃圾过滤、相关性判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多分类</td>\n<td>3-100</td>\n<td>Softmax, 决策树</td>\n<td>意图分类、主题标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多标签</td>\n<td>多个</td>\n<td>二分类组合</td>\n<td>文档标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级分类</td>\n<td>树形</td>\n<td>层级分类器</td>\n<td>类目体系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"特征工程与文本表示\">特征工程与文本表示</h2><p>传统文本分类的特征工程是将非结构化文本转换为结构化数值向量的过程。词袋模型（Bag of Words）是最基础的表示——每个词项对应一个特征维度，值为 TF-IDF 权重。</p>\n<p>N-gram 特征通过捕获相邻词的共现来引入有限的词序信息。Bigram &quot;machine learning&quot; 和 &quot;deep learning&quot; 作为独立特征可以区分不同的技术主题，而单独的 &quot;learning&quot; 则过于泛化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FeatureExtractor {&#10;  extract(text: string): FeatureVector;&#10;  vocabulary: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface FeatureVector {&#10;  readonly features: Map&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;  readonly norm: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createTfidfExtractor = (&#10;  documents: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;,&#10;  config: { maxFeatures: number; ngramRange: [number, number]; minDf: number },&#10;): FeatureExtractor =&gt; {&#10;  const vocabulary = buildVocabulary(documents, config);&#10;  const idfValues = computeIDF(documents, vocabulary);&#10;  return {&#10;    vocabulary,&#10;    extract: (text) =&gt; {&#10;      const tokens = tokenize(text);&#10;      const features = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;      for (const term of vocabulary) {&#10;        const tf = tokens.filter((t) =&gt; t === term).length;&#10;        if (tf &gt; 0) {&#10;          features.set(term, (1 + Math.log(tf)) * (idfValues.get(term) ?? 0));&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;      const norm = Math.sqrt([...features.values()].reduce((s, v) =&gt; s + v * v, 0));&#10;      return { features, norm };&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureExtractor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  extract</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureVector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  vocabulary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureVector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> features</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> norm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createTfidfExtractor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  documents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">maxFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ngramRange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">minDf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureExtractor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> vocabulary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildVocabulary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(documents, config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idfValues</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeIDF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(documents, vocabulary);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vocabulary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    extract</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tokenize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> features</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> term</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vocabulary) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokens.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> term).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          features.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(term, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tf)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (idfValues.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(term) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> norm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">features.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { features, norm };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>现代文本分类使用预训练语言模型（BERT、RoBERTa）进行文本表示。与 TF-IDF 的稀疏高维向量不同，BERT 生成的是 768 维的稠密向量，能够捕获深层语义信息。BERT 分类器在大多数文本分类基准上大幅超越了传统特征工程方法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示方法</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>语义能力</th>\n<th>训练需求</th>\n<th>推理速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TF-IDF</td>\n<td>10K-100K</td>\n<td>词汇级</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Word2Vec 均值</td>\n<td>100-300</td>\n<td>词级语义</td>\n<td>预训练</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FastText</td>\n<td>100-300</td>\n<td>子词级语义</td>\n<td>预训练</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BERT [CLS]</td>\n<td>768</td>\n<td>句级语义</td>\n<td>微调</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分类算法\">分类算法</h2><p>朴素贝叶斯（Naive Bayes）是文本分类中最经典的算法。它基于贝叶斯定理和词项独立假设，计算每个类别生成给定文档的概率。尽管独立假设在实际中几乎不成立，朴素贝叶斯在文本分类上表现出人意料地好——特别是在训练数据较少时。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 分类算法比较&#10;        NB[朴素贝叶斯] --&gt; S1[训练快、可解释]&#10;        SVM[SVM] --&gt; S2[高维有效、泛化好]&#10;        LR[逻辑回归] --&gt; S3[概率输出、可校准]&#10;        BERT[BERT 微调] --&gt; S4[深层语义、最高精度]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 分类算法比较\n        NB[朴素贝叶斯] --&gt; S1[训练快、可解释]\n        SVM[SVM] --&gt; S2[高维有效、泛化好]\n        LR[逻辑回归] --&gt; S3[概率输出、可校准]\n        BERT[BERT 微调] --&gt; S4[深层语义、最高精度]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TextClassifier {&#10;  train(documents: ReadonlyArray&lt;LabeledDocument&gt;): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  predict(text: string): Promise&lt;ReadonlyArray&lt;Prediction&gt;&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LabeledDocument {&#10;  readonly text: string;&#10;  readonly label: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Prediction {&#10;  readonly label: string;&#10;  readonly probability: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const createNaiveBayes = (): TextClassifier =&gt; {&#10;  let classPriors = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;  let termLikelihoods = new Map&lt;string, Map&lt;string, number&gt;&gt;();&#10;  let vocabulary = new Set&lt;string&gt;();&#10;  return {&#10;    train: async (documents) =&gt; {&#10;      const classCounts = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;      const classTermCounts = new Map&lt;string, Map&lt;string, number&gt;&gt;();&#10;      for (const doc of documents) {&#10;        classCounts.set(doc.label, (classCounts.get(doc.label) ?? 0) + 1);&#10;        const tokens = tokenize(doc.text);&#10;        if (!classTermCounts.has(doc.label)) classTermCounts.set(doc.label, new Map());&#10;        const termMap = classTermCounts.get(doc.label)!;&#10;        for (const token of tokens) {&#10;          vocabulary.add(token);&#10;          termMap.set(token, (termMap.get(token) ?? 0) + 1);&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;      const totalDocs = documents.length;&#10;      for (const [label, count] of classCounts) {&#10;        classPriors.set(label, Math.log(count / totalDocs));&#10;        const termMap = classTermCounts.get(label)!;&#10;        const totalTerms = [...termMap.values()].reduce((s, v) =&gt; s + v, 0);&#10;        const likelihoods = new Map&lt;string, number&gt;();&#10;        for (const term of vocabulary) {&#10;          likelihoods.set(term, Math.log(((termMap.get(term) ?? 0) + 1) / (totalTerms + vocabulary.size)));&#10;        }&#10;        termLikelihoods.set(label, likelihoods);&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    predict: async (text) =&gt; {&#10;      const tokens = tokenize(text);&#10;      const scores = [...classPriors.entries()].map(([label, prior]) =&gt; {&#10;        const likelihoods = termLikelihoods.get(label)!;&#10;        const logProb = tokens.reduce(&#10;          (sum, token) =&gt; sum + (likelihoods.get(token) ?? Math.log(1 / (vocabulary.size + 1))),&#10;          prior,&#10;        );&#10;        return { label, logProb };&#10;      });&#10;      const maxLogProb = Math.max(...scores.map((s) =&gt; s.logProb));&#10;      const expSum = scores.reduce((sum, s) =&gt; sum + Math.exp(s.logProb - maxLogProb), 0);&#10;      return scores&#10;        .map((s) =&gt; ({ label: s.label, probability: Math.exp(s.logProb - maxLogProb) / expSum }))&#10;        .sort((a, b) =&gt; b.probability - a.probability);&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextClassifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  train</